# Nearpod

> Nearpod is an interactive teaching platform that helps K-12 and higher education teachers create engaging, data-driven lessons. It combines real-time formative assessment, interactive activities, and curriculum-aligned content in one platform.

## Product

Nearpod enables teachers to deliver live (synchronous) and student-paced (asynchronous) lessons with built-in activities like quizzes, polls, open-ended questions, collaborate boards, VR field trips, and more. Teachers get real-time reports and insights on student performance.

