## Pricing

Full machine-readable pricing: https://nearpod.com/pricing.md
Human-readable pricing page: https://nearpod.com/pricing

- **Silver** - Free. 300 MB storage, 40 students/session.
- **Gold** - $159/year. 1 GB storage, 75 students/session. Includes AI Create Question Generator, Google Slides add-on, Sub Plans.
- **Platinum** - $397/year. 5 GB storage, 90 students/session. All Gold features plus student notes.
- **School & District License** - Custom pricing. Unlimited storage, 250 students/session. Full AI Create, LMS/LTI integrations, admin dashboards, dedicated Customer Success Manager.

Request a quote: https://nearpod.com/request-quote

